<title>ANGOLA: Portuguese defence minister visits Angola.</title>
<headline>Portuguese defence minister visits Angola.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese Defence Minister Antonio Vitorino arrived in the Angolan capital Luanda on Monday for a two-day visit, government officials said.</p>
<p>He is due to meet his Angolan counterpart Pedro Sebastiao later on Monday, they said. Angola was a Portuguese colony until 1975.</p>
